<%% content_for :preheader, "The password for your account was changed." %>
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;">Your password was changed</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#374151;line-height:1.7;">The password for <strong><%%= @user.email %></strong> was successfully changed.</p>
<div style="margin:22px 0;padding:16px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;color:#374151;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">All existing sessions were signed out. Sign in again using your new password.</div>
<p style="margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;">If you did not make this change, contact support immediately and secure your email account.</p>
